:: Files
<h2>The old 1971 search files</h2>
<p>Boxes of maps marked with grid squares. In 1971, searchers walked the forest near Ariel and Lake Merwin, square by square.</p>
<p class="quote">"Mud, steep hills, endless trees," an agent says. "No parachute. No money. No body."</p>
<<clue "nothing">>
<<clue "planner">>
<p>Clipped to the last box is a newer note.</p>
<<clue "placard">>
<<tomap>>


:: Newsroom
<h2>The newspaper office</h2>
<p>The Cooper story is back on every front page, and everyone has a theory.</p>
<p class="quote">"He's on a beach in Mexico, spending it," says one reporter. "No way," says another. "That beach is his grave."</p>
<<clue "rich">>
<<clue "dead">>
<<tomap>>


:: Theories [nobar]
<div class="stamp">Theory board</div>
<h2>How did the money get to Tena Bar?</h2>
<p>Four theories. For each one, decide: can your evidence <b>rule it out</b>, or is it <b>still possible</b>?</p>
<div id="thlist"><<include "TheoryList">></div>
<div id="thgo"><<include "TheoryGo">></div>


:: TheoryList
<<for _t range setup.theories>><<capture _t>>
<div class="sortrow"><p class="card-title"><<print _t.text>></p>
<div class="choices two"><<for _k range [["out","Ruled out"],["possible","Still possible"]]>><<capture _k>><span @class="$th[_t.id] is _k[0] ? 'opt chosen' : 'opt'"><<link _k[1]>><<set $th[_t.id] to _k[0]>><<replace "#thlist">><<include "TheoryList">><</replace>><<replace "#thgo">><<include "TheoryGo">><</replace>><</link>></span><</capture>><</for>></div></div>
<</capture>><</for>>


